 style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>rtswan<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'll probably end up using the one who has contract with the resort. The fee 500 USD plus three nights stay are just too much for me. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> and we want a private dinner, which is not included in the package.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It's $500 fee OR 3 night stay.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photography by Tamm's Photos<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/466\/192\/20090425\/Our+Wedding+in+Riviera+Maya\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/466\/1...aya\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"behm.11@osu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1200485158,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208250.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JHarwood2Be","Id":208250,"Name":"JHarwood2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9fecdb43aefde3155bfded64f703e53","RawContent":"I got my confirmation yesterday!! Yay! Now, I&#039;m officially in this thread.\n \n Just a question - when do you actually speak to the WC to discuss location, menu option (private event) and any other private events (welcome cocktails)? Did you guys schedule a call or did you do everything over email?","Attachments":[],"Id":363949,"PostDate":1214939417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got my confirmation yesterday!! Yay! Now, I'm officially in this thread.<br \/> <br \/> Just a question - when do you actually speak to the WC to discuss location, menu option (private event) and any other private events (welcome cocktails)? Did you guys schedule a call or did you do everything over email?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"p_amarose@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1213493787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209956.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pepper55","Id":209956,"Name":"pepper55","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cce4ae20387a8f1be3124d414f3ac5e","RawContent":"I&#039;m waiting for confirmation too. I e-mailed Fabio, and he got back to me a few days later. Told me to fill out the online app and I would hear back about my date very quickly. That was weeks ago, and I still haven&#039;t heard anything. So I guess not? Still waiting!","Attachments":[],"Id":363991,"PostDate":1214940491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm waiting for confirmation too. I e-mailed Fabio, and he got back to me a few days later. Told me to fill out the online app and I would hear back about my date very quickly. That was weeks ago, and I still haven't heard anything. So I guess not? Still waiting!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i57.photobucket.com\/albums\/g209\/kacie3344\/Wedding%20Pro%20Teasers\/firstkissasmarried-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i57.photobucket.com\/albums\/g2...smarried-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/3dzh1ilhlaiz.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/3dzh1ilhlaiz.png<\/a><br><br><br><strong>OUR SLIDESHOW!<\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.josephmark.com\/StuartandCasey\/\">http:\/\/www.josephmark.com\/StuartandCasey\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"caseysatullo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1213214100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209890.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Casey*","Id":209890,"Name":"*Casey*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e46f44293dd19dd2b1a08a08d4b9448a","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;Congrats pepper55&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Official!!!! YAY!\n \n I still don&#039;t have all the details yet. I think a large part of it has to do with the hotel not being open yet. They are probably still working on the locations where things can be held, etc.\n \n I&#039;m anxious to get everything set and done. I guess patience is the key here but it&#039;s working one on me. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile41.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile41\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":364223,"PostDate":1214948126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>Congrats pepper55<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Official!!!! YAY!<br \/> <br \/> I still don't have all the details yet. I think a large part of it has to do with the hotel not being open yet. They are probably still working on the locations where things can be held, etc.<br \/> <br \/> I'm anxious to get everything set and done. I guess patience is the key here but it's working one on me. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile41.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile41\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wendy.ivan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"130.219.8.220","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211512645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209543.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"weddingchick","Id":209543,"Name":"weddingchick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2ce14a5858558ce490813bb1590bca2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kacie3344&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m waiting for confirmation too. I e-mailed Fabio, and he got back to me a few days later. Told me to fill out the online app and I would hear back about my date very quickly. That was weeks ago, and I still haven&#039;t heard anything. So I guess not? Still waiting!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Try emailing him again or you could call him. I did call once and got him right away. He is totally swamped though. My communication is through email.","Attachments":[],"Id":364228,"PostDate":1214948313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kacie3344<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm waiting for confirmation too. I e-mailed Fabio, and he got back to me a few days later. Told me to fill out the online app and I would hear back about my date very quickly. That was weeks ago, and I still haven't heard anything. So I guess not? Still waiting!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Try emailing him again or you could call him. I did call once and got him right away. He is totally swamped though. My communication is through email.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wendy.ivan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"130.219.8.220","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211512645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209543.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"weddingchick","Id":209543,"Name":"weddingchick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe3a96dcec291d4bdec1b6c3b0c6df7d","RawContent":"It took Fabio a few days to get back to me. I did send a few follow up emails so he didn&#039;t forget about me. What held mine up was getting confirmation from the judge, so maybe that&#039;s what is going on...\n \n Keeping my fingers crossed for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":364271,"PostDate":1214949791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It took Fabio a few days to get back to me. I did send a few follow up emails so he didn't forget about me. What held mine up was getting confirmation from the judge, so maybe that's what is going on...<br \/> <br \/> Keeping my fingers crossed for you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"p_amarose@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1213493787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209956.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pepper55","Id":209956,"Name":"pepper55","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4efb709e1785a84e3a7c443061fb969","RawContent":"Casey, like the others said send Fabio an email. If you have filled out the application, it shouldn&#039;t take weeks. Maybe one week tops!","Attachments":[],"Id":364636,"PostDate":1214964025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Casey, like the others said send Fabio an email. If you have filled out the application, it shouldn't take weeks. Maybe one week tops!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photography by Tamm's Photos<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/466\/192\/20090425\/Our+Wedding+in+Riviera+Maya\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/466\/1...aya\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"behm.11@osu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1200485158,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208250.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JHarwood2Be","Id":208250,"Name":"JHarwood2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"To