bsp; I just recently got engaged and we have decided on a Jamaica wedding!! Anyone planning a wedding at Grand Palladium??? Any information about the resort that you have would be amazing!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887616,"PostDate":1424980909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!\u00a0 I'm pretty new to this site:)\u00a0 I just recently got engaged and we have decided on a Jamaica wedding!! Anyone planning a wedding at Grand Palladium??? Any information about the resort that you have would be amazing!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessvandong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.36.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424208255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jvandong","Id":282144,"Name":"Jvandong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.183.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78847,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bee05d93046262c7c7d9783f0db9fb18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What in particular do you want information about @[member=\"Jvandong\"]? Let me so I be of help :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888008,"PostDate":1425323524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What in particular do you want information about @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282144\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282144-jvandong\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jvandong<\/span><\/a>? Let me so I be of help :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashi2hot@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.183.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425320109,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrookM","Id":282293,"Name":"BrookM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.237.29.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78847,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ffdb868c6d54908a157c295fb1a65ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BrookM\"] any information would be helpful!! The best location for the ceremony, the best time for the wedding, any info related to the wedding packages, photography, etc! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888157,"PostDate":1425404098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282293\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282293-brookm\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BrookM<\/span><\/a> any information would be helpful!! The best location for the ceremony, the best time for the wedding, any info related to the wedding packages, photography, etc! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessvandong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.36.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424208255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jvandong","Id":282144,"Name":"Jvandong","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78847","Title":"Any Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton Weddings!?!","LastPostDate":1425404098},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
