{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"685d5553b6bf616b0ae379b8f87625e1","RawContent":"Hi! Been browsing on here for a while but this is my first post. I&#039;m getting married at the lady hamilton in June 2015..wedding date still to be confirmed..and was wondering if there are any more of you out there?! Would be so helpful to discuss things with others :)  Katie x","Attachments":[],"Id":1859597,"PostDate":1405377383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! Been browsing on here for a while but this is my first post. I'm getting married at the lady hamilton in June 2015..wedding date still to be confirmed..and was wondering if there are any more of you out there?! Would be so helpful to discuss things with others <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  Katie x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loopykatz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381273970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274100.jpg?_r=1406583827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katieals","Id":274100,"Name":"katieals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.158.92","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0f2a97f0206be349bdecef08d5f0d2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Katie,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my first post too! We are getting married in April 2015 and looking into Grand Palladium Riviera Maya though. Location in Jamaica looks awesome, I do like the resort design a lot more than the one in Mexico, but I find Mexicans have really good food, mind you I have never been to Jamaica lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859858,"PostDate":1405456738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Katie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my first post too! We are getting married in April 2015 and looking into Grand Palladium Riviera Maya though. Location in Jamaica looks awesome, I do like the resort design a lot more than the one in Mexico, but I find Mexicans have really good food, mind you I have never been to Jamaica lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations and happy planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tim_alia@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.126.158.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405409006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Aliyusha","Id":279015,"Name":"Aliyusha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b81e5edebdbc18f00494d407a0882ecd","RawContent":"Congratulations to you too! I&#039;ve never been to Mexico..a friend of mine is getting married there July 2015 but my sure where abouts..i should tell her about this website! It&#039;s helped me make decisions already with the things others have posted..I just can&#039;t wait to get things moving :) good luck woth your planning aliyusha!","Attachments":[],"Id":1859874,"PostDate":1405464834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations to you too! I've never been to Mexico..a friend of mine is getting married there July 2015 but my sure where abouts..i should tell her about this website! It's helped me make decisions already with the things others have posted..I just can't wait to get things moving <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> good luck woth your planning aliyusha! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loopykatz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381273970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274100.jpg?_r=1406583827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katieals","Id":274100,"Name":"katieals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.172.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8353d48f37b21eaa8d06ccafd87e44b","RawContent":"I am highly considering the GP resorts in RM. So far they seem to have the best wedding package prices and flight\/accommodations prices.\nDoes anyone know if there are any perks\/credits that can be used to go towards the wedding? I know some resorts offer this","Attachments":[],"Id":1862429,"PostDate":1406349762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am highly considering the GP resorts in RM. So far they seem to have the best wedding package prices and flight\/accommodations prices.<br \/>Does anyone know if there are any perks\/credits that can be used to go towards the wedding? I know some resorts offer this\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryluong@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.172.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405286690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"maredith","Id":278988,"Name":"maredith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0e2aec8b8bfe3efd8c268c5f0c3ddd1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at the Grand Palladium in Jamaica on May 7th, 2015 and we&#039;re staying for 2 weeks on the Lady Hamilton side of the resort!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been to this resort before, in 2013. My sister and her friend both got married at this resort so I am familiar with the process and hotel accommodations etc...if you have any questions please ask away&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862691,"PostDate":1406508450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at the Grand Palladium in Jamaica on May 7th, 2015 and we're staying for 2 weeks on the Lady Hamilton side of the resort!!<\/p>\n<p>I have been to this resort before, in 2013. My sister and her friend both got married at this resort so I am familiar with the process and hotel accommodations etc...if you have any questions please ask away<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eagommer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396034331,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277379.jpg?_r=1397626633","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsMichaud","Id":277379,"Name":"FutureMrsMichaud","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.165.85.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ea8b9334d14d2642b025ff4a073cba8","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married at Grand Palladium Mayan Riviera. .theres a group on FB tht has been very very helpful!! its for the brides... BMW Grand Palladium Riviera Maya","Attachments":[],"Id":1862698,"PostDate":1406512133,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married at Grand Palladium Mayan Riviera. .theres a group on FB tht has been very very helpful!! its for the brides... BMW Grand Palladium Riviera Maya\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crazycdngirl26@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"71.17.139.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344506438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJTK","Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35da03b1f45756468db484ed95f92ee4","RawContent":"Hi futuremrsmichaud!\n\n\nI have also been to the lady hamilton in 2012..it&#039;s where my fianc\u00e9 proposed to me :) we loved it so much it seemed only right to get married there. You guys will be out there before us..how is your planning going? I&#039;ve not got anything sorted as yet..apart from my dress lol\n\nKatie x","Attachments":[],"Id":1862874,"PostDate":1406586643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi futuremrsmichaud!<br><br>\nI have also been to the lady hamilton in 2012..it's where my fianc\u00e9 proposed to me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we loved it so much it seemed only right to get married there. You guys will be out there before us..how is your planning going? I've not got anything sorted as yet..apart from my dress lol<br>\nKatie x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loopykatz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381273970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274100.jpg?_r=1406583827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katieals","Id":274100,"Name":"katieals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.165.85.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e53077ccb6e7fd101956b15f1b9bb732","RawContent":"Well your ahead of me..I haven&#039;t even went dress shopping lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1862943,"PostDate":1406617018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well your ahead of me..I haven't even went dress shopping lol \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crazycdngirl26@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"71.17.139.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344506438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJTK","Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0af3b4992ff596850be6b7cabcebc710","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations everyone! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m getting married at the Grand Palladium in March 2015. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone hear any reviews on their spa? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m a little nervous to just go with them because I cant find reviews on their hair salon. &amp;nbsp;Is anyone going with an outside vendor? &amp;nbsp;If so, how much does it cost to bring them onsite for the morning?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863954,"PostDate":1406919308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations everyone! \u00a0I'm getting married at the Grand Palladium in March 2015. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone hear any reviews on their spa? \u00a0I'm a little nervous to just go with them because I cant find reviews on their hair salon. \u00a0Is anyone going with an outside vendor? \u00a0If so, how much does it cost to bring them onsite for the morning?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406918896,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95116c8adeaae6c0355b26508028097b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"katieals\" post=\"1862874\" timestamp=\"1406583043\"]\nHi futuremrsmichaud!\n\nI have also been to the lady hamilton in 2012..it&#039;s where my fianc\u00e9 proposed to me :) we loved it so much it seemed only right to get married there. You guys will be out there before us..how is your planning going? I&#039;ve not got anything sorted as yet..apart from my dress lol\nKatie x[\/quote]\nHey Katie!\n\nThe planning is going great, I&#039;m actually pretty organized and ahead at the moment. Most of which is because I am already familiar with the resort and wedding process. I&#039;m heading home to Ontario next week for dress shopping at Kleinfelds in Toronto &amp;lt;3. I have gotten my maids and groomsmen in order before myself lol\n\nAre you excited to be going back? Your dress is the most important! I&#039;m excited for you. What have you chosen for your ceremony and reception?","Attachments":[],"Id":1863987,"PostDate":1406922895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>katieals, on 28 July 2014 - 02:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi futuremrsmichaud!<br><br>\nI have also been to the lady hamilton in 2012..it's where my fianc\u00e9 proposed to me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we loved it so much it seemed only right to get married there. You guys will be out there before us..how is your planning going? I've not got anything sorted as yet..apart from my dress lol<br>\nKatie x<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey Katie!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The planning is going great, I'm actually pretty organized and ahead at the moment. Most of which is because I am already familiar with the resort and wedding process. I'm heading home to Ontario next week for dress shopping at Kleinfelds in Toronto <3. I have gotten my maids and groomsmen in order before myself lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you excited to be going back? Your dress is the most important! I'm excited for you. What have you chosen for your ceremony and reception?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eagommer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396034331,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277379.jpg?_r=1397626633","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsMichaud","Id":277379,"Name":"FutureMrsMichaud","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
